### Testes das consultas (extensao REST Client do VS Code)
### O backend precisa estar rodando (npm.cmd run dev:backend).

@api = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Login (rode primeiro)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@example.com", "senha": "sgrb123" }

### Painel da tela inicial
GET {{api}}/consultas/painel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lotacao dos piquetes
GET {{api}}/consultas/lotacao
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ranking de GMD por animal
GET {{api}}/consultas/gmd?agrupar=animal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GMD medio por raca
GET {{api}}/consultas/gmd?agrupar=raca
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GMD medio por fornecedor
GET {{api}}/consultas/gmd?agrupar=fornecedor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Animais em carencia
GET {{api}}/consultas/carencia
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reforcos atrasados
GET {{api}}/consultas/reforcos?situacao=Atrasado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vacinacao obrigatoria pendente
GET {{api}}/consultas/campanhas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
